rp>(</rp><rt>さむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>冬<rp>(</rp><rt>ふゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>越<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せるのだろうか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们怎么能在那个帐篷里度过寒冷的冬天呢?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">擦る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">摩擦；擦拭；刮；反复使用（笑话、话题等）；反复炒作；持续榨取价值；连按；狂按（按钮或技能）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229129\">いすで<ruby>床<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をこすらないでちょうだい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不要再打地板了,好吧。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">梢</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こずえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">树梢；枝梢</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">個性</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">个性；性格；特质；怪癖；特点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113360\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすばらしい<ruby>個性<rp>(</rp><rt>こせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他有一个很好的性格。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/833250\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">戸籍</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こせき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">户籍；户口簿；人口普查</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91469\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだ<ruby>夫<rp>(</rp><rt>おっと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>戸籍<rp>(</rp><rt>こせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她还没有在丈夫的门口。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">小銭</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こぜに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">零钱；硬币；小额金钱；小笔钱款</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155891\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>小銭<rp>(</rp><rt>こぜに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わせがない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我没有小钱。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">個体</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こたい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">个体；样本</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">固体</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こたい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n